# ============================================================
# Private / sensitive source documents: NEVER commit these.
#
# Free GitHub Pages has no server, no login, and no way to gate
# a single file: anything pushed to a public repo is public to
# anyone with the URL, indexable by search engines, and kept in
# git history even after you delete it later. Everything below
# is real personal documentation extracted from your portfolio
# PDF, kept here only for your own reference and for you to
# selectively re-attach later if you ever want to (e.g. behind
# a real login, or emailed individually on request).
#
# The public website never links to any file in these folders.
# See documents/README.md for the full public/private index.
# ============================================================

